/**
 * Fixed data tables for the Brother (PEC/PES) and Janome (JEF) writers and readers. They are copied, value for value,
 * from pyembroidery (MIT licence, EmbroidePy: EmbThreadPec.py, EmbThreadJef.py, PecGraphics.py), because the machines
 * match thread colours against these exact charts and show this exact thumbnail frame. Do not edit by hand: the
 * self-test compares them with pyembroidery's own tables.
 */

